            -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "other than one to which subsection (3) applies"
            -- MARGINAL (a): "other than" is read like "except": a contract to which s 12(3) applies has no implied condition under s 12(1); the other reading is that the exclusion limits the grant and the subsection is then silent (s 12(4) and (5) give that contract warranties instead).
