-- src:457 | appropriate cases aspects of the quality of goods:
-- src:459 | (a) fitness for all the purposes for which goods of the kind in
-- src:460 | question are commonly supplied;
-- src:462 | (b) appearance and finish;
-- src:464 | (c) freedom from minor defects;
-- src:466 | (d) safety;
-- src:468 | (e) durability.
